# The frontend currently runs 100% client-side against the browser's
# IndexedDB - it makes no network calls and holds no secrets, so there is
# nothing required here today. Nothing below is read by any code yet; it's a
# placeholder for if/when you wire the UI to call apps/backend's API instead
# of (or in addition to) IndexedDB. Only variables prefixed VITE_ are exposed
# to the browser bundle by Vite - never put a real secret in a VITE_ var,
# since it ships to every visitor's browser in plain text.

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-deployed-backend.example.com
